  "guidance_candidates": [
    {
      "text": "On the Home Screen and Lock Screen of their iPhone and iPad",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f7923b2555990bd7addcd4dd824a36fad481f0349e9a6cbc8bfcca9443a5b0c2",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "On the desktop and Notification Center of their Mac",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "79ee5546deb5fc279389263e0554f4d509b8c3f4d70926d34f8684f6e748996f",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "On a horizontal or vertical surface when they wear Apple Vision Pro",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3acb431bf67964cddc25df457239f4b33e729a79ef4e5e5c76a1b1b19621c06e",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "At a fixed position in the Smart Stack of Apple Watch",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "12cabafa7d20dfca45dc9c9242e7bab5b1952540e7b4bcce264151b8edb53a25",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The widget size to support",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e7f519b3a96078b103241b0d80eaaf85b3e04591025f41de20aee001d2469e52",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "The context — devices and system experiences — in which the widget may appear",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e0263a398c4227e3a576eda4b260555e7ae2472fbb509870ec6deae833915b2b",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "The rendering modes and color treatment that the widget receives based on the size and context",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b6f1601bf6bc6ab277f799b5befe4cc15b7dad121c867dd012d571d3676c15ee",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "System family widgets",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "System family widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "992261dfd63cc5bd7f5231c159de9534f144eea7463a7e0c7b83a307faf8c7c2",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Accessory widgets",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "Accessory widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "44f998a7a4870220c94b3d00d6035869284cf15a1e9f2bd2500981b8ba20c5bd",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Lock Screen of iPad, the widget takes on a monochromatic appearance without a tint color",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "Appearances"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "569a7ebbfa15335a5876d7dfbcb5b67c4504055328bc8fba8f4dd79a9827ca99",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Lock Screen of iPhone in StandBy, the widget appears scaled up in size with the background removed.",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "Appearances"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e52b1240a6ffe63459a69a4d1946d7725f10cce76859d982a91c0a1f0131944c",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Lock Screen of iPhone and iPad, it takes on a monochromatic appearance without a tint color",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "Appearances"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "600c835d6a352dad8a36ba3eed141c866c03acf13b448dd67426194355670092",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "On Apple Watch, the widget can appear as a watch complication in both full-color and tinted appearances, and it",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "Appearances"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b49d956118ab33ad4a6707eec722564198e5f8d12a37a33cc71a73f482407865",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "The system uses the full color rendering mode for system family widgets across all platforms to display your widget",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Anatomy",
        "Appearances"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "df22f6e1e76dd485d8c6d0f8c5a65021d5a7dc047be9b011938b597f3194722d",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose simple ideas that relate to your app’s main purpose",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0bf5f200a3e7f25d7136f2988b414576aad2202b5e06cea1d1e84c47ccfefe7b",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Aim to create a widget that gives people quick access to the content they want",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "46f60c59346ec0ac26775fa57db69f43b346212a353972c663e82d938fded495",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer dynamic information that changes throughout the day",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "88d05cfee850e96f9c4f4817d9afe16cfc29e0133641194a4d7c351ee1ef9833",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Look for opportunities to surprise and delight",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7dc2bc2cca35bfb4d1a5d9c6d9bb8d8f946fc62ba88701655b8c156fa30befe2",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer widgets in multiple sizes when doing so adds value",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "07179c11694e36693c7df0561497c8b38012c451c9517f0cd3a2aeb9f239fbca",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Balance information density",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "461fb855fdd13018851d106c6cefdb962b7b24eca1e028e87266484c2f544222",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Display only the information that’s directly related to the widget’s main purpose",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "05a1bb1ef01d4efc232842f6b6023347ae6f1c573bc5602fdcaf07c36e3d2373",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Use brand elements thoughtfully",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f18fe198758a0c7af3510f5009bd41d68efe8ba721f57115aa838f8ffeefb3c2",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose between automatically displaying content and letting people customize displayed information",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "096e46928b7176a2b3e3ef431875d8e4723e167f682b743079b33358ce2640b8",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid mirroring your widget’s appearance within your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2ea05fec273d303f60e845ac721b9c35d84b58ae4e92089fb9783dd427b8ea94",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Let people know when authentication adds value",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e059a6326a309d6013459435bd14f20acec4786be85a029d39b933df1047f6e1",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Updating widget content",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Updating widget content"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2c5f5c3d7bcd063a72f1709164b1b0fff721a525d63f3d1859df62847f9a51d3",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep your widget up to date",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Updating widget content"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5b6491119b4a7eefbc551f6ac722cc72b91896ee289ea818bc7a147ce7b812e9",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Use system functionality to refresh dates and times in your widget",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Updating widget content"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "bfa4fcadb79530bbcb680339f22bea52006ab862569ae93f5338a5c8004ea9ad",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Use animated transitions to bring attention to data updates",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Updating widget content"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "595056839f37cbac4ac650a5453dba6fefa2ae884c7b892ad46ab56607ff662c",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding interactivity",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Adding interactivity"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "ab1cdf8394aff09c64cf3cb227499570452d54e1e32fb96bcb7b9b8dc7f92b01",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer simple, relevant functionality and reserve complexity for your app",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Adding interactivity"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c3c45a287a9db2d8d500b43779b520d2463b3adbfa3a70f55ce084f153a44108",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Ensure that a widget interaction opens your app at the right location",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Adding interactivity"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9df6175f91e9e5cac7031cb392bf9f76fe984ed4287f9e5768d6a588db0ecd1d",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer interactivity while remaining glanceable and uncluttered",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Adding interactivity"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4a7bd483be96103e5b471b3dc3ced9ef7fc7764a2f966dccdae28eb0dc303af9",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Choosing margins and padding",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Choosing margins and padding"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6b2226b07ba340aedea1f5d49616b470b99316558679ad0cd5643888e71caa35",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "In general, use standard margins to ensure legibility",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Choosing margins and padding"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "928f18cca5c2afc94b5b920cf3824037178b0457e806e04e10441309dc1ae805",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Coordinate the corner radius of your content with the corner radius of the widget",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Choosing margins and padding"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4a76a2e1e3e9dc31b8c6034246d139af34b34521fbfa2d6bb040bb89558a4bb7",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Displaying text in widgets",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Displaying text in widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c07d5ef501d9d67196f5d71f29b207dc6caba11da3ac56b2f5fa63fe1990a32a",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Prefer using the system font, text styles, and SF Symbols",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Displaying text in widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "adaa2b8b5e1de30e0408b97a1cf2207783d68c8855e0f0ccae59214e8f2dac21",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid very small font sizes",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Displaying text in widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1f3cba60d48c34db6fc5e0a7d6414e9d317a355ccd7781d041137c45c4165f67",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid rasterizing text",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Displaying text in widgets"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "06773c5555ee554f6abd894d3628ccd24765a93f4b3282585f8c743a9f2a803c",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Using color",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Using color"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "3e6b63f902a438895273d11054e3b493537550570b898aa003192d238011ad62",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Use color to enhance a widget’s appearance without competing with its content",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Using color"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6d64c39dc2afbef670404f77e4ca3857e3792c7fdad7c6c43b924acb603dd7f7",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Convey meaning without relying on specific colors to represent information",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Using color"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "c5012958d681ab88050fdf5184865d82dc94aede713ff46dbe25d5a5e9b8f0db",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Use full-color images judiciously",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Best practices",
        "Using color"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6b92e5ccd427d777596a5a10ce4fbb7c44ffd8f2090387f3f2c110d9f2c712b0",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Support light and dark appearances",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Rendering modes",
        "Full-color"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2ddb7e8174fd32a428a4d394601a1ad3d29782d20bb68c57d083625297378f52",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Group widget components into an accented and a primary group",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Rendering modes",
        "Accented"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9f235843144d1ffe1ebee561770197c572c4564291bd10b526a8d229f115879a",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer enough contrast to ensure legibility",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Rendering modes",
        "Vibrant"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "6771334330d6d34cfd2b055444b18ff94319113ffb93f246080fb8283e093582",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Create optimized assets for the best vibrant effect",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Rendering modes",
        "Vibrant"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "533a874b268b31710c2a05f1d8ac1cdb570c75a989a4d2b031aa991168041a56",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Design a realistic preview to display in the widget gallery",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Previews and placeholders"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "9305d206c4ee42e818f38f99279377db3e8e3ba6784ebf1b13e7da12234d6d40",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Design placeholder content that helps people recognize your widget",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Previews and placeholders"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2fa3dae7a244c59212808841cae60d71f7353d1f58f58e2850f5e3300020aaa5",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Write a succinct widget description",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Previews and placeholders"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "128d482c62e1d3243721ab88f49395e0f429032b5b0362f9a91b8eedfb48a5ba",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Group your widget’s sizes together, and provide a single description",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Previews and placeholders"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "e57cb06a5d15b08da0203ab7b44db80d0fdbddea9fa73b5a1645e4c8ea200c0c",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider coloring the Add button",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Previews and placeholders"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7ffa749050678fb9f970f1a03387299e1531a013ed282cdc76c569a77b6b7ea6",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "iOS, iPadOS",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iOS, iPadOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "aea7203623b032aeb5e694acb18f1b1ac4defd9a0428ff1d7826233c1b3c3a21",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Support the Always-On display on iPhone",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iOS, iPadOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "540d1484eea7c41e6b63b0eb20ce0e7b51ddf9c5d2e4a421fe73ea2a3e008cbe",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer Live Activities to show real-time updates",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iOS, iPadOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "116514d43963a1d4117b06aa6707976d3a3c3b01be0e6ad1b42386f2dbc67a75",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "StandBy and CarPlay",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iOS, iPadOS",
        "StandBy and CarPlay"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "5998685f3be216edc242a2f67ad884ebcf66204ff9de0686eaa2f33068d09d6c",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Limit usage of rich images or color to convey meaning in StandBy",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "iOS, iPadOS",
        "StandBy and CarPlay"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "bb39e98af03ba8c0b2e9268d184980661989b999b3c3dee4eacc16bdaaffd559",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Adapt your design and content for the spatial experience Apple Vision Pro provides",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2379c40e018ae775776f33f5fe5fa371ff167b06dd6943664a97a31525a9ab95",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Test your widgets across the full range of system color palettes and in different lighting conditions",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1b377025994ebf2d97434c0c8d4b0e22665bd1d5307417402d227cf1319d4c68",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Thresholds and sizes",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Thresholds and sizes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8fddc0749ba84fc5e7c309c1ea6032c7f404443d22e7bc67f1dcbb5773c92739",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Design a responsive layout that shows the right level of detail for each of the two thresholds",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Thresholds and sizes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "957da2f9b7c0181b07b92a2c57433e5faff0f502f8ec8c893aa92a4722cb42c5",
      "word_count": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "Offer widget family sizes that fit a person’s surroundings well",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Thresholds and sizes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "b61d96de74b0bf7669bbde8e2f96a4fd134ea5cf8a3bd9604192329b855b55db",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Display content in a way that remains legible from a range of distances",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Thresholds and sizes"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "acf43ffb5ade33beaef9df18444c56e9bb49240ef4e7d8414ee8d2f707c74783",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Mounting styles",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Mounting styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "4c511c2240f217237738b4f8f2d9aca9362b65c66d9978c1fdb54d10c63225c4",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Elevated style",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Mounting styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "0618381a4f6b201292dd0404d41000ee99f51a4eeccd10ef131df0cf3b992a6d",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Recessed style",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Mounting styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "266d120685fd9056a0434e15d3f3bea3a78b2dd75a159410fa00194755181e4b",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose the mounting style that fits your content and the experience you want to create",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Mounting styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "7b31a3feb0d766ff9bcbd08f26676f113bce6f8b1a65cf9bcaef809d46c04ac1",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Test your elevated widget designs with each system-provided frame width",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Mounting styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "1ccaafa1af50455e35fbe1730a78b6578a4e908815e2d0627a7ffe564fee6ebd",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Treatment styles",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Treatment styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "968b131ca9e47557f1dd0b7cfc3d62a6d178dbf27be0880df09239a28a4ba56d",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "The paper style creates a more grounded, print-like style that feels solid and makes the widget feel like part",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Treatment styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "f69ace7c2ff5feb0f9a1aaa7178f3731a6011be243961e118af6032bfc8e1f45",
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose the paper style for a print-like look that feels more like a real object in the room",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Treatment styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "22ca543eeb76e3952f2bd89f0506be7ac06cf0283b29a15b04a364121310cbcc",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose the glass style for information-rich widgets",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "visionOS",
        "Treatment styles"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "2e4d1b7dcffff4ea147b538257719cc54ac26f77ce0aa9f018666c34fccc24d2",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Provide a colorful background that conveys meaning",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "watchOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "8d8a611bafb3deea68fcca1931d2977430be04fa0f42f28331f3daeaec374597",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Encourage the system to display or elevate the position of your watchOS widget in the Smart Stack",
      "section_path": [
        "Widgets",
        "Platform considerations",
        "watchOS"
      ],
      "source_sentence_hash": "a6000b88d230d749b71b70ec0e4a917bcf900d3e2340202e1ba701ba729964ce",
      "word_count": 17
    },
